  "description": "AiTO CMS Translation Extension for Dynamicweb 10, developed by Mardi Gras, simplifies the export and import of translatable CMS content.\n\t\t\tThe app supports text fields from pages, paragraphs and Swift 2 item types. Content is exported in a translation-friendly format and imported directly back into the correct language version, reducing manual work and minimizing errors.\n\t\t\t<br /><br />\n\t\t\tFully compatible with both Dynamicweb SaaS Cloud and On-Premise environments. Requires Dynamicweb 10.27.10 or higher.\n\t\t\t<br /><br />\n\t\t\tRead more and get started: <a href=\"https://mardigras.se/aito\" target=\"_blank\">https://mardigras.se/aito</a><br /><br />\n\t\t\tFor support or inquiries, contact Mardi Gras at <a href=\"mailto:support@mardigras.se\">support@mardigras.se</a>",
  "iconFile": "Logo_AiTO.png",
